This flow can be called in two different ways:
1) By the flow &quot;Redistribute Cases Related to Person Accounts or No Account - Screen Flow&quot;
2) By the Process Builder process &quot;User - Redistribute Cases Related to Person Accounts or No Account&quot;</description>
